      "value": "<p>You touch a creature to undo a debilitating effect. You can reduce the target’s exhaustion level by one, or end one of the following effects on the target:\n<em> One effect that charmed or petrified the target\n</em> One curse, including the target’s bond to a cursed item (not devil fruits).\n<em> Any reduction to one of the target’s ability scores\n</em> One effect reducing the target’s hit point maximum</p>",
